      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RHETORIC (1) brings the strongest recent form after closing impressively for third on the turf, beaten just over half a length, and his record at around 1050m is strong. He was wide and unable to quicken in a BM65 at the Sunny Coast Coast two back, so the latest effort reads as the better guide. STEFFI ELECTRICA (3) is the obvious danger, having been run down late when odds-on at this track and also coming off a narrow BM74 second at Coffs. SUN SISTER (6) has been less effective of late but has earlier form that measures up. Not dismissing completely. JEANS (5) returns and strips for a recent trial here on the turf. Looks best of the rest.",
